function parseFeatures(text){const result=new Map();let current=null;const finish=()=>{if(current)result.set(current.id,current);};for(const raw of catalogLines(text)){if(raw.startsWith("N:")){finish();const parts=raw.split(":");current={id:Number(parts[1]),name:parts.slice(2).join(":"),glyph:"?",color:"w",flags:new Set()};}else if(current&&raw.startsWith("G:")){const parts=raw.split(":");current.glyph=parts[1]||" ";current.color=parts[2]||"w";}else if(current&&raw.startsWith("F:"))splitFlags(raw).forEach(flag=>current.flags.add(flag));}finish();return result;}
